    "detailed_description": "Noah, you have one task : to allow two of each animal onto the Ark before the Great Flood.<br><br>To do so, you shall be granted the ability to <strong>WHACK</strong>! Use it to push animals you don't need away from the ark and knock them out!<br><br>Furthermore, you shall be modestly bestowed with <strong>energy orbs</strong>, which you shall use judiciously in your effort to manage the boarding.<br><br>Watch out for <strong>funny-looking animals</strong>; if you see one of those, you'll wanna put it down quick before it starts outrunning ya. <br><br>Finally, the <strong>Minimap</strong> will prove a worthy tool at your disposal. <br><br><strong>Spots are limited!</strong>",
